### Box Webhook Listener Test Requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)

#@baseUrl = http://localhost:7979
@baseUrl = https://w7mj4zpq-7979.use2.devtunnels.ms
### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Simulate FILE.UPLOADED Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
BOX-DELIVERY-ID: test-delivery-001
BOX-DELIVERY-TIMESTAMP: {{$datetime iso8601}}

{
  "type": "webhook_event",
  "id": "test-event-001",
  "created_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "trigger": "FILE.UPLOADED",
  "webhook": {
    "id": "webhook-123",
    "type": "webhook"
  },
  "created_by": {
    "type": "user",
    "id": "user-456",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "login": "john.doe@example.com"
  },
  "source": {
    "type": "file",
    "id": "file-789",
    "name": "quarterly-report.pdf",
    "parent": {
      "type": "folder",
      "id": "folder-123",
      "name": "Reports"
    }
  }
}

